  "task": "damage-aware parallel-jaw squeeze: two rigid sticky plates close on the object along its narrower horizontal axis by d*W/2 each over 1.0 s, hold until 1.5 s, open (plates removed), free relaxation until 4.0 s; gravity, floor collider; same MPM settings as V2 main/C1 (low damping, substep 1e-4, n_grid from template).",
