  "damage_metric": "crush",
  "damage_metric_definition": "PRIMARY. permanent crush = (span_ref - span_sq_aligned) / W: span = 1-99 % quantile extent along the squeeze axis of all MPM particles averaged over 3.5-4.0 s (after release); the squeezed configuration is first rigidly (Procrustes) aligned to the reference (d=0 run, same parameters), so rigid rotation after release is not counted; W = initial width along the squeeze axis (narrower horizontal axis)",
  "gravity": "off for the task (g=0): under the V2-main gravity setting most elastoplastic objects slump to a puddle in <0.5 s (pilot figure docs/v3e/figs/pilot_particles_gravity.png), which makes a grasp ill-posed",
